    heading: "agoraedulaunchconfig",
    content: `The room ID. This is the globally unique identifier of a classroom. The string length must be less than 64 bytes. Supported character scopes are:- All lowercase English letters: a to z.All numeric characters.- 0-9

- The space character.

- "!", "#", "$", "%", "&", "(", ")", "+", "-", ":", ";", "\\<", "=", ".", ">", "?", "@", "\\[", "]", "^", "\\_", " {", "}", "\\|", "\\~", ","`
